### Create cart (optional items — replaces contents if cart already exists)
POST {{host}}/app/carts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "9971dc5f-5d21-4d32-8146-3766515d549b",
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}

### Get cart
GET {{host}}/app/carts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get cart with items (soft assessment: valid, issues, summary)
GET {{host}}/app/carts?includeItems=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get cart with items + stock vs a branch
GET {{host}}/app/carts?includeItems=true&branchId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validate cart (hard fail on invalid items; optional coupon / loyalty)
POST {{host}}/app/carts/validate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "couponCode": "SAVE10",
  "loyaltyPointsAmount": 100,
  "type": "DELIVERY",
  "branchId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "addressId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
}

### Update cart (replaces full contents — omitted products are removed)
PATCH {{host}}/app/carts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "9971dc5f-5d21-4d32-8146-3766515d549b",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Clear cart items
PATCH {{host}}/app/carts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": []
}

### Delete cart
DELETE {{host}}/app/carts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
